# Hylderblade's Void: Bot1 casts Hylderblade (B from Mox Jet) and two creatures, then Lightning Bolts its own Memnite with the
# Mox Ruby, so a nonland permanent left the battlefield this turn. At the beginning of Bot1's end step the Blade attaches
# itself to target creature Bot1 controls - the Ornithopter, the only one left - which is 0/2 + 3/+1 = 3/3. (Without it
# the Blade stays unattached: hylderblade-nothing-left-so-it-stays-put-and-equip-costs-exactly-four.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Hylderblade
Memnite
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hylderblade.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Hylderblade.AttachedTo = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Hylderblade.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Lightning Bolt
